<title>INDIA: INDIA'S DSP MERRILL LYNCH NET ASSET VALUE ON FUNDS.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S DSP MERRILL LYNCH NET ASSET VALUE ON FUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's DSP Merrill Lynch said on Friday the net asset value it's schemes as of August 11, 1997 is as follows:</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>    Name of the fund     NAV   Purchase Price     Sale Price</p>
<p>    ----------------     ---   --------------     -----------</p>
<p>    BOND FUND	     10.56	 10.56		10.56</p>
<p>    EQUTIY FUND	   12.86	 13.26		12.86</p>
<p>-</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
</text>
